OL,3,GNEWSAReform continues boycott of Senedd
OL,4,Achamber
OL,5,
OL,6,FReform Members of the Senedd (MSs) are
OL,7,Fcontinuing their boycott of Senedd
OL,8,Fdebates.
OL,10,FThe protest, which began last
OL,11,FWednesday, is in response to the
OL,12,Fpresiding officer's decision to ban a
OL,13,FReform MS from speaking until he
OL,14,Fapologises for "offensive" comments
OL,15,Fmade a day earlier.
OL,23,APub: 17-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBWales NewsC Reg TVFClean Feed
FL,439,430,260,140,0,100
