OL,3,GNEWSAReform continues boycott of Senedd
OL,4,Achamber
OL,5,
OL,6,FAhead of Tuesday's full Senedd meeting
OL,7,FReform's leader in Wales Helen Jenner
OL,8,Fsaid discussions had taken place with
OL,9,Fthe Llywydd - the Senedd's Presiding
OL,10,FOfficer Huw Irranca-Davies - but the
OL,11,FReform group was "not satisfied with
OL,12,Fthe progress that had been made".
OL,14,FA spokesperson for the Llywydd said his
OL,15,Fposition had not changed. The first
OL,16,Fminister accused Reform of a
OL,17,F"dereliction of duty".
OL,23,APub: 17-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
